{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "eab2bdec-d73e-4dcc-8f19-267a1a53e125",
    "name": "Real Time Chat",
    "description": "REST API for the Real-Time Chat App. Socket.io events (send_message, join_conversation, edit_message, etc.) are documented in the project README and are not exercised here since Postman doesn't speak Socket.io — this collection covers the REST surface: auth, user profile, and conversation/message endpoints, including the negative/error paths for each.\n\nRun order for a clean pass: Auth > Register User A, Register User B, Register User C, then everything else — later requests reuse the tokens/ids those three capture automatically via collection variables.",
